  "description": "Immerse yourself in the audacious spirit of street culture with Vandal Soul, a 3D layered graffiti font teeming with individuality and raw energy. Characterized by its unique cracked detailing, this font evokes the unruly and rugged charm of urban graffiti. It injects a rebellious vibe into all of your designs, making it the quintessential choice for an urban-themed concept. The layered styles of Vandal Soul give your text a dimensional depth, rendering a striking street-style effect that refuses to be overlooked. Unleash your creativity on posters, hip-hop ventures, streetwear branding, album covers, murals, and more with this perfectly mottled and tactile font. Vandal Soul, with its authentically textured aesthetic and energized dynamics, truly encapsulates the essence of urban artistry.",
  "fullDescription": "<p>Immerse yourself in the audacious spirit of street culture with Vandal Soul, a 3D layered graffiti font teeming with individuality and raw energy. Characterized by its unique cracked detailing, this font evokes the unruly and rugged charm of urban graffiti. It injects a rebellious vibe into all of your designs, making it the quintessential choice for an urban-themed concept. The layered styles of Vandal Soul give your text a dimensional depth, rendering a striking street-style effect that refuses to be overlooked. Unleash your creativity on posters, hip-hop ventures, streetwear branding, album covers, murals, and more with this perfectly mottled and tactile font. Vandal Soul, with its authentically textured aesthetic and energized dynamics, truly encapsulates the essence of urban artistry.</p>",
